Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Floating-window / Smart-Island style tweak for rootless jailbreaks. Stage 1 ships the complete settings surface (64 items, key-for-key with the reference) plus a read-only probe harness. Still zero hooks.
